{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../../store/abstract/", "title": "Abstract"}, "next": {"link": "../../error/", "title": "Error"}, "title": "Encrypt", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-encryption.encrypt\">\n<span id=\"encrypt\"></span><h1>Encrypt<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-encryption.encrypt\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<section id=\"attributes\">\n<h2>Attributes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#attributes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.ALG\" title=\"encryption.encrypt.ALG\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ALG</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.BYTE_LENGTH\" title=\"encryption.encrypt.BYTE_LENGTH\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BYTE_LENGTH</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.DIGEST\" title=\"encryption.encrypt.DIGEST\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DIGEST</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.ENC\" title=\"encryption.encrypt.ENC\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ENC</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.ENCRYPTION_INFO\" title=\"encryption.encrypt.ENCRYPTION_INFO\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ENCRYPTION_INFO</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"functions\">\n<h2>Functions<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#functions\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.decrypt\" title=\"encryption.encrypt.decrypt\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">decrypt</span></code></a>(\u2192 dict)</p></td>\n<td><p>Decrypts the JWE token back to the original payload.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.derive_encryption_key\" title=\"encryption.encrypt.derive_encryption_key\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">derive_encryption_key</span></code></a>(\u2192 bytes)</p></td>\n<td><p>Derives a key using HKDF with SHA-256.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.encrypt\" title=\"encryption.encrypt.encrypt\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">encrypt</span></code></a>(\u2192 str)</p></td>\n<td><p>Encrypts the given payload into a JWE using the direct algorithm and A256CBC-HS512 encryption.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"encryption.encrypt.decrypt\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">encryption.encrypt.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">decrypt</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">secret</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">salt</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#encryption.encrypt.decrypt\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Decrypts the JWE token back to the original payload.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"encryption.encrypt.derive_encryption_key\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">encryption.encrypt.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">derive_encryption_key</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">secret</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a 